{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790438191778,"sessionID":"ses_f219326b5ffevkJDPjGxW3nWrD","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_cf3bc4f41cb44f1495bc17df","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore codebase structure","prompt":"Explore the /workspace directory thoroughly. I need to understand:\n1. The full directory tree structure\n2. The contents of res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\n3. The contents of res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\n4. The contents of res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n5. Any existing custom_nodes directory and files\n6. Any Team enum definitions\n7. Any BattleUnit class definitions\n\nReturn ALL file contents in full.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f219290b7ffeSsR6YF7LsGy2D8\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is the complete exploration of the `/workspace` directory.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Full Directory Tree Structure\n\n```\n/workspace/\n├── .godot/\n│   ├── .gdignore\n│   ├── editor/\n│   │   ├── filesystem_cache10\n│   │   ├── main.tscn-folding-3ad5c15c4f3250da0cc7c1af1770d85f.cfg\n│   │   └── project_metadata.cfg\n│   ├── global_script_class_cache.cfg\n│   ├── imported/\n│   ├── scene_groups_cache.cfg\n│   └── uid_cache.bin\n├── data/\n│   ├── enemies/\n│   │   └── zombie.tres\n│   └── units/\n│       ├── bjorn.tres\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd\n│       └── unit_stats.gd.uid\n├── project.godot\n├── scenes/\n│   ├── battle_unit/\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd.uid\n│   │   └── battle_unit.tscn\n│   └── main.tscn\n├── scripts/                         (empty directory)\n└── task_config.json\n```\n\nThere is **no** `custom_nodes/` directory yet. The `scripts/` directory exists but is empty.\n\n---\n\n## 2. `res://data/units/unit_stats.gd`\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name UnitStats\nextends Resource\n\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n\nconst MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n\n@export var team: Team\n@export_range(1, MAX_ATTACK_RANGE) var attack_range: int = 1\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name BattleUnit\nextends Area2D\n\n@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tif stats:\n\t\t_set_stats(stats)\n\n\nfunc _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n\tstats = value\n\t\n\tif not stats or not is_node_ready():\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tstats = value.duplicate()\n\tcollision_layer = stats.team + 1\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n\n```ini\n[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_stats\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"1_body_shape\"]\nsize = Vector2(24, 24)\n\n[node name=\"BattleUnit\" type=\"Area2D\"]\ncollision_mask = 0\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\nshape = SubResource(\"1_body_shape\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Custom Nodes Directory\n\n**No `custom_nodes/` directory exists anywhere under `/workspace`.** The glob search for `**/custom_nodes/**` returned zero results. The `scripts/` directory exists but is empty.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Team Enum Definitions\n\nFound in **one location**:\n\n**File:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`, **Line 4:**\n```gdscript\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n```\n\nThis is the only `Team` enum definition in the entire codebase. It defines two values:\n- `Team.PLAYER` (integer value 0)\n- `Team.ENEMY` (integer value 1)\n\nThe enum is used in the resource files:\n- `bjorn.tres` has `team = 0` (PLAYER)\n- `zombie.tres` has `team = 1` (ENEMY)\n\n---\n\n## 7. BattleUnit Class Definitions\n\nFound in **one location**:\n\n**File:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`, **Line 1:**\n```gdscript\nclass_name BattleUnit\nextends Area2D\n```\n\n`BattleUnit` is a registered global class (confirmed by `.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`) that extends `Area2D`. It has:\n- One exported property: `stats: UnitStats` with a setter `_set_stats`\n- A `_ready()` callback that applies stats\n- A `_set_stats()` method that duplicates the stats resource and sets `collision_layer = stats.team + 1`\n\n---\n\n## Supporting Files (also read in full)\n\n### `/workspace/project.godot`\n```ini\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\nconfig/name=\"Detect Range Target Finder\"\nconfig/description=\"Minimal autobattler targeting task derived from the GodotGameLab combat-preparation tutorial\"\nrun/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.4\")\n\n[rendering]\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\n```\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n```ini\n[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_player_stats\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/enemies/zombie.tres\" id=\"3_enemy_stats\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n\n[node name=\"DroneUnit\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"security_drones\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(0, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_player_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"IntruderClose\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"intruders\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(55, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"IntruderDistant\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"intruders\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(130, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n```\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/bjorn.tres`\n```ini\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 0\nattack_range = 3\n```\n\n### `/workspace/data/enemies/zombie.tres`\n```ini\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 1\nattack_range = 1\n```\n\n### `/workspace/task_config.json`\n```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the security drone contact tracking setup from the tutorial. In `res://data/units/unit_stats.gd`, define `TARGET = { Team.PLAYER: \\\"intruders\\\", Team.ENEMY: \\\"security_drones\\\" }` so units can look up the opposing group name from their team. Create `res://custom_nodes/detect_range.gd` as `class_name DetectRange` extending `Area2D` with exported `col_shape: CollisionShape2D`, `base_range_size: float`, and `stats: UnitStats`; when `stats` is assigned, set `collision_layer` to `4 * (stats.team + 1)`, set `collision_mask` to `2 - stats.team`, and replace the collision shape with a `CircleShape2D` whose radius is `base_range_size * stats.attack_range`. Create `res://custom_nodes/target_finder.gd` as `class_name TargetFinder` extending `Node` with an exported `actor: BattleUnit`, a `target: BattleUnit`, a `targets_in_range: Array[BattleUnit]`, and a `targets_in_range_changed` signal. On ready, connect the actor's `DetectRange.area_entered` and `area_exited` signals to handlers that append or erase only `BattleUnit` instances and emit `targets_in_range_changed`. Implement `find_target()` so it uses `UnitStats.TARGET`, `get_nodes_in_group()`, and `distance_squared_to()` to store the closest opposing `BattleUnit` in `target`, and implement `has_target_in_range()` to return whether `targets_in_range` is non-empty. In `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`, add a `DetectRange` Area2D child with a `CollisionShape2D` child and a sibling `TargetFinder` node, wire both to the battle unit, and in `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` expose them as `detect_range` and `target_finder` onready variables while assigning `detect_range.stats = stats` when battle-unit stats are set.\"\n}\n```\n\n### `/workspace/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`\n```ini\nlist=[{\n\"base\": &\"Area2D\",\n\"class\": &\"BattleUnit\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"is_abstract\": false,\n\"is_tool\": false,\n\"language\": &\"GDScript\",\n\"path\": \"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\"\n}, {\n\"base\": &\"Resource\",\n\"class\": &\"UnitStats\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"is_abstract\": false,\n\"is_tool\": false,\n\"language\": &\"GDScript\",\n\"path\": \"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\"\n}]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Item | File Path |\n|---|---|\n| `UnitStats` class + `Team` enum | `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` |\n| `BattleUnit` class | `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` |\n| BattleUnit scene | `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn` |\n| Main scene | `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn` |\n| Bjorn resource (PLAYER, range 3) | `/workspace/data/units/bjorn.tres` |\n| Zombie resource (ENEMY, range 1) | `/workspace/data/enemies/zombie.tres` |\n| Task instructions | `/workspace/task_config.json` |\n| Custom nodes directory | **Does not exist yet** |\n| `scripts/` directory | Exists but is **empty** |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f219326b5ffevkJDPjGxW3nWrD","sessionId":"ses_f219290b7ffeSsR6YF7LsGy2D8","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore codebase structure","time":{"start":1790438109004,"end":1790438191765}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_988d8f2b-580b-4f45-a07a-4fd9cc9fba05"}},"id":"prt_0de6d6f42001gL129axnKDk5cQ","sessionID":"ses_f219326b5ffevkJDPjGxW3nWrD","messageID":"msg_0de6d2719001gx91IcDI0KFlNB"}}
